{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ8TmzA64FgJejHqpSdT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01B8Ky65deJtH96yfNd266hM","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-002-VNwr4k/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\">\n  <title>合账 · 小团队在线记账</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"合账是给 3–30 人小团队用的在线记账工具：多人一起记、拍票自动识别、报销在线审批，月底一键导出给会计。\">\n  <!-- measure.css 放在第一个，measure 层排在最前，下面的页面样式都优先于它 -->\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"measure.css\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">合</span>合账</a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\" aria-label=\"主导航\">\n      <a href=\"#features\">功能</a>\n      <a href=\"#reviews\">用户评价</a>\n      <a href=\"#pricing\">价格</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-small\" href=\"#signup\">免费注册</a>\n    </nav>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main>\n  <section class=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"wrap hero-grid\">\n      <div>\n        <h1>团队的每一笔钱，<br>大家都看得清。</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">合账是给 3–30 人小团队用的在线记账工具。成员随手记账、拍票上传，负责人在线审批报销，月底一键导出给会计，不用再追着人要发票。</p>\n        <div class=\"hero-actions\">\n          <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"#signup\">免费注册，30 秒开账本</a>\n          <a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"#features\">看看能做什么</a>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"hero-note\">5 人以内永久免费，不需要绑定银行卡。</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"ledger\" aria-label=\"账本示例\">\n        <div class=\"ledger-head\">\n          <strong>设计工作室 · 10 月</strong>\n          <span>共 4 人记账</span>\n        </div>\n        <table>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <td>客户 A 项目尾款<span class=\"who\">林舟 · 10 月 24 日</span></td>\n              <td class=\"in\">+ 18,000.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>办公室房租<span class=\"who\">陈默 · 10 月 20 日</span></td>\n              <td class=\"out\">− 6,500.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>打车去客户现场（已报销）<span class=\"who\">许晴 · 10 月 18 日</span></td>\n              <td class=\"out\">− 86.50</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>字体与素材订阅<span class=\"who\">周野 · 10 月 15 日</span></td>\n              <td class=\"out\">− 398.00</td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n        <div class=\"ledger-foot\"><span>本月结余</span><span>11,015.50</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"stats\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"stat\"><b>12,000+</b><span>个小团队在用</span></div>\n      <div class=\"stat\"><b>20 分钟</b><span>平均月底对账用时</span></div>\n      <div class=\"stat\"><b>98%</b><span>发票识别准确率</span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"block\" id=\"features\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"block-head\">\n        <h2>功能介绍</h2>\n        <p>从记一笔账到交给会计，中间的事合账都帮你做了。</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"feature-main\">\n        <div>\n          <h3>报销不再靠微信群接龙</h3>\n          <p class=\"measure-prose\">成员拍一张发票就能提交报销，金额、日期、抬头自动识别。负责人在手机上点一下就能批，批完自动记进账本，谁报了多少、还差谁没报，一目了然。</p>\n        </div>\n        <ol class=\"steps\">\n          <li><div><strong>拍票提交</strong><span>支持纸质发票、电子发票和小票照片。</span></div></li>\n          <li><div><strong>负责人审批</strong><span>可以设置金额上限，超出才需要审批。</span></div></li>\n          <li><div><strong>自动入账</strong><span>审批通过后按类别记账，附件一并归档。</span></div></li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n\n      <dl class=\"feature-list\">\n        <div>\n          <dt>多人共用一个账本</dt>\n          <dd>按成员分配权限：有人只能记账，有人能看报表，有人能审批。每一次修改都有记录。</dd>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <dt>按项目、按客户分账</dt>\n          <dd>给每笔收支打上项目标签，随时看某个项目赚了多少、花了多少。</dd>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <dt>预算提醒</dt>\n          <dd>给差旅、采购等类别设月度预算，快超支时提前通知负责人。</dd>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <dt>一键导出给会计</dt>\n          <dd>导出 Excel 明细和发票压缩包，格式按代账公司常用模板整理好。</dd>\n        </div>\n      </dl>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block reviews\" id=\"reviews\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"block-head\">\n        <h2>用户评价</h2>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"quote-lead\">“以前每个月底要花一整天对账、催发票。用合账以后，同事当天花的钱当天就记好了，我月底只需要点一下导出。”</p>\n      <p class=\"quote-by\">王琳，某 12 人设计工作室行政负责人</p>\n\n      <div class=\"quote-grid\">\n        <figure>\n          <blockquote><p>“我们是 6 个人的独立游戏团队，没有专职财务。合账的项目分账让我们第一次算清楚了每个项目的真实成本。”</p></blockquote>\n          <figcaption>赵一帆，独立游戏工作室创始人</figcaption>\n        </figure>\n        <figure>\n          <blockquote><p>“报销审批放到手机上之后，同事提交到报销到账从一周缩短到两天，大家抱怨少多了。”</p></blockquote>\n          <figcaption>刘佳，跨境电商团队运营主管</figcaption>\n        </figure>\n        <figure>\n          <blockquote><p>“代账会计说我们导出的表是她见过最整齐的，再也不用来回问这笔钱是干什么的。”</p></blockquote>\n          <figcaption>孙浩，咖啡店合伙人</figcaption>\n        </figure>\n        <figure>\n          <blockquote><p>“预算提醒很实用，差旅费快超的时候会提前告诉我，不会等到月底才发现。”</p></blockquote>\n          <figcaption>何静，咨询公司项目经理</figcaption>\n        </figure>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block\" id=\"pricing\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"block-head\">\n        <h2>价格</h2>\n        <p>按团队人数收费，随时升级或降级。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"plans\">\n        <div class=\"plan\">\n          <h3>免费版</h3>\n          <p class=\"price\">¥0 <small>/ 永久</small></p>\n          <p>适合刚起步的小团队。</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>最多 5 名成员</li>\n            <li>1 个账本，不限记账笔数</li>\n            <li>每月 50 张发票识别</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"plan featured\">\n          <h3>团队版</h3>\n          <p class=\"price\">¥15 <small>/ 每人每月</small></p>\n          <p>报销审批、预算和导出全部可用。</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>最多 30 名成员</li>\n            <li>不限账本和发票识别次数</li>\n            <li>报销审批流、预算提醒、会计导出</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block signup\" id=\"signup\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div>\n        <h2>今天就开一个团队账本</h2>\n        <p>注册后可以直接邀请同事加入。团队版功能免费试用 14 天，到期不会自动扣费。</p>\n      </div>\n      <form class=\"signup-form\" id=\"signup-form\" novalidate>\n        <label>工作邮箱\n          <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"name@company.com\" required autocomplete=\"email\">\n        </label>\n        <label>团队名称\n          <input type=\"text\" name=\"team\" placeholder=\"例如：林舟设计工作室\" required>\n        </label>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" type=\"submit\">免费注册</button>\n        <p class=\"form-tip\" id=\"form-tip\">注册即表示同意《服务条款》和《隐私政策》。</p>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n\n<footer>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <span>© 2026 合账</span>\n    <span>服务条款 · 隐私政策 · 联系我们</span>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n\n<script>\n  document.getElementById('signup-form').addEventListener('submit', function (e) {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    var form = e.target;\n    var tip = document.getElementById('form-tip');\n    var email = form.email.value.trim();\n    var team = form.team.value.trim();\n    if (!/^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/.test(email)) {\n      tip.textContent = '请填写有效的邮箱地址。';\n      form.email.focus();\n      return;\n    }\n    if (!team) {\n      tip.textContent = '请填写团队名称。';\n      form.team.focus();\n      return;\n    }\n    tip.className = 'form-done';\n    tip.textContent = '注册成功！我们已向 ' + email + ' 发送了激活邮件。';\n    form.querySelector('button').disabled = true;\n  });\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4554,"cache_read_input_tokens":46000,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4554},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"stan